{
    "title": "Call of Duty\u00ae: Warzone\u2122 Mobile",
    "description": "Drop into real Call of Duty action with exhilarating FPS Battle Royale and Multiplayer gameplay, featuring Call of Duty: Warzone style combat and weapons with real graphics. Squad up for PvP battles, and fight to win in this Battle Royale mobile game.\r\n\r\nExplore iconic FPS Battle Royale maps, Verdansk and Rebirth Island. Enter Shipment, Shoot House, and Scrapyard, high-octane Multiplayer maps in Call of Duty, built for fun, fast-paced firefights. Powered by Call of Duty technology, with Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile you can level up shared weapons, earn shared XP, and bring it all to Call of Duty: Modern Warfare\u00ae III and Call of Duty: Warzone for the ultimate connected Call of Duty experience.\r\n\r\nMULTIPLAYER FPS ACTION LIKE NEVER SEEN BEFORE\r\nFight for survival in this thrilling action game built for mobile. Tactical multiplayer combat,  PvP shooting mechanics, and fast team-based action\u2014all at your fingertips. \r\n\r\nGAMEPLAY YOUR WAY \r\nCall of Duty: Warzone Mobile delivers on immersive gameplay with next level graphics and customization. Discover more with Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile Originals \u2014 weapons, operators, events, and Battle Pass content that is currently only on mobile. Omnimovement is an innovative movement system that introduces the Omni Sprint, Omni Slide, and Omni Dive \u2014 allowing mobile players the freedom to move horizontally in a myriad of directions and to perform as many combat maneuvers as imaginable. From the air to the ground, Omnimovement brings immersive speed, velocity, and reactivity to Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 & Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile. Coming soon to Season 1!\r\n\r\nWE GOT THE MAPS \r\nReturn to Verdansk and Rebirth Island, deploying to your favorite Points of Interest and wreaking PvP havoc on enemies!\r\n\r\nMORE REAL PLAYERS \r\nShowoff your battle skills by surviving and dominating the frontlines against real players in competitive Battle Royale matches. Squad up and build your best tactical team to defeat rivals in PvP battles.\r\n\r\nCALL OF DUTY AS ONE\r\nWorld class Call of Duty cross-progression technology allows you to take shared weapons, operators, and Battle Pass XP with you anywhere on mobile. Jump into exciting Battle Royale action and enjoy the FPS multiplayer battlefield together\u2014 anywhere, anytime. \r\n\r\nSurvival is only the beginning. \r\n\r\nMINIMUM DEVICE SPECIFICATIONS \r\nAdreno 618 or better. 4GB RAM or more. \r\n\r\n*Battle Pass cross-progression is shared with certain titles (sold separately). See www.callofduty.com/warzonemobile for more details. \r\n\r\nThis app contains social features that allow you to connect and play with friends. Enable push notifications to be informed when exciting events and new content are taking place in the game. You can choose whether to utilize these features. Requires a persistent internet connection (network fees may apply). Age restrictions apply. Allows players to communicate. Includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items. \r\n\r\nRequires acceptance of Activision\u2019s privacy policy and software terms of use. Please visit https://www.activision.com/legal/privacy-policy to view Activision\u2019s privacy policy \r\n\r\n\u00a9 2024 Activision Publishing, Inc. ACTIVISION, CALL OF DUTY, and CALL OF DUTY WARZONE are trademarks of Activision Publishing, Inc. Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. All other trademarks and trade names are the property of their respective owners. \r\n\r\nPlease contact customer service if you encounter any problems: CODWarzoneMobile@activision.com  \r\nPlease see terms and conditions here: https://www.callofduty.com/warzonemobile/warzonemobile-terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Drop into real Call of Duty action with exhilarating FPS Battle Royale and Multiplayer gameplay, featuring Call of Duty: Warzone style combat and weapons with real graphics. Squad up for PvP battles, and fight to win in this Battle Royale mobile game.<br><br>Explore iconic FPS Battle Royale maps, Verdansk and Rebirth Island. Enter Shipment, Shoot House, and Scrapyard, high-octane Multiplayer maps in Call of Duty, built for fun, fast-paced firefights. Powered by Call of Duty technology, with Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile you can level up shared weapons, earn shared XP, and bring it all to Call of Duty: Modern Warfare\u00ae III and Call of Duty: Warzone for the ultimate connected Call of Duty experience.<br><br>MULTIPLAYER FPS ACTION LIKE NEVER SEEN BEFORE<br>Fight for survival in this thrilling action game built for mobile. Tactical multiplayer combat,  PvP shooting mechanics, and fast team-based action\u2014all at your fingertips. <br><br>GAMEPLAY YOUR WAY <br>Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile delivers on immersive gameplay with next level graphics and customization. Discover more with Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile Originals \u2014 weapons, operators, events, and Battle Pass content that is currently only on mobile. Omnimovement is an innovative movement system that introduces the Omni Sprint, Omni Slide, and Omni Dive \u2014 allowing mobile players the freedom to move horizontally in a myriad of directions and to perform as many combat maneuvers as imaginable. From the air to the ground, Omnimovement brings immersive speed, velocity, and reactivity to Call of Duty: Black Ops 6 &amp; Call of Duty: Warzone Mobile. Coming soon to Season 1!<br><br>WE GOT THE MAPS <br>Return to Verdansk and Rebirth Island, deploying to your favorite Points of Interest and wreaking PvP havoc on enemies!<br><br>MORE REAL PLAYERS <br>Showoff your battle skills by surviving and dominating the frontlines against real players in competitive Battle Royale matches. Squad up and build your best tactical team to defeat rivals in PvP battles.<br><br>CALL OF DUTY AS ONE<br>World class Call of Duty cross-progression technology allows you to take shared weapons, operators, and Battle Pass XP with you anywhere on mobile. Jump into exciting Battle Royale action and enjoy the FPS multiplayer battlefield together\u2014 anywhere, anytime. <br><br>Survival is only the beginning. <br><br>MINIMUM DEVICE SPECIFICATIONS <br>Adreno 618 or better. 4GB RAM or more. <br><br>*Battle Pass cross-progression is shared with certain titles (sold separately). See www.callofduty.com/warzonemobile for more details. <br><br>This app contains social features that allow you to connect and play with friends. Enable push notifications to be informed when exciting events and new content are taking place in the game. You can choose whether to utilize these features. Requires a persistent internet connection (network fees may apply). Age restrictions apply. Allows players to communicate. Includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items. <br><br>Requires acceptance of Activision\u2019s privacy policy and software terms of use. Please visit https://www.activision.com/legal/privacy-policy to view Activision\u2019s privacy policy <br><br>\u00a9 2024 Activision Publishing, Inc. ACTIVISION, CALL OF DUTY, and CALL OF DUTY WARZONE are trademarks of Activision Publishing, Inc. Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. All other trademarks and trade names are the property of their respective owners. <br><br>Please contact customer service if you encounter any problems: CODWarzoneMobile@activision.com  <br>Please see terms and conditions here: https://www.callofduty.com/warzonemobile/warzonemobile-terms",
